<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman upgrades Gemex.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman upgrades Gemex.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said analyst William Landers upgraded Pepsi-Gemex SA de C. to outperform from neutral, with a 12-month price target of $15 per ADR.</p>
<p>-- The company recently changed its name from Grupo Embotellador de Mexico SA de CV.</p>
<p>-- Landers in a report cited strong operating margin performance by the company in its first quarter.</p>
<p>-- Its ADRs rose 1/4 to 11-1/4.</p>
</text>
